{{Quote|Have you checked out the new T-17s?''"<br />"''The T-17s, as far as I can tell, are a great improvement.''"<br />"''Yeah. That's what they tell you. But believe me, they don't hold up.''"<br />"''They don't?''"<br />"''No.|A pair of stormtroopers discuss the T-17|<ref name="awakens">{{Film|VII}}</ref>}}
[[Rey Skywalker|Rey]] once overheard a pair of [[First Order]] [[First Order stormtrooper|stormtroopers]] discussing the new '''T-17''' while on [[Starkiller Base]]. One of them thought that they were a "great improvement," though the other replied that "they don't hold up," and implied he knew from personal experience.<ref name="awakens" />

==Behind the scenes==
The T-17 mentions in {{Film|VII}} and {{Film|VIII}} were added by voice actor [[Sam Witwer]] as a reference to a conversation in {{Film|IV}} between two stormtroopers who are discussing the [[BT-16]] while [[Obi-Wan Kenobi]] disables the [[tractor beam]]. Witwer also added similar lines in ''[[Rogue One: A Star Wars Story]]'' and ''[[Solo: A Star Wars Story]]'', which mention the [[T-15]], and in {{Film|IX}} which mentions the [[T-18]]. Similar reference to the [[T-16 skyhopper|T-16]] was added in "[[Part III]]" of the series ''[[Star Wars: Obi-Wan Kenobi]]''. The mention depended on the era.<ref name="Sam Witwer">{{YouTube|video=Z8UdXvynS50|text=Sam Witwer - Matt Lanter - Star Wars Celebration 2022 - DAY 4 Panel|channel=UCX2BSSVDZbk5PrppNQREfTA|name=Super Steve|date=29-05-2022}}</ref>

